{{fbdoc item="title" value="gettext"}}----
An internationalization library/toolchain

Website: http://www.gnu.org/software/gettext/gettext.html
Platforms supported: Windows, Linux, FreeBSD, Haiku
Headers to include: libintl.bi, gettext-po.bi
Header version: from 2010, 0.17

FreeBSD and Haiku provide the translation functions in a separate libintl library; the binding selects it automatically. On glibc Linux these functions are supplied by the C library. Plural counts use C unsigned long, which is 64 bits on Unix x86-64 and 32 bits on Windows. Passing a large count through a fixed 32-bit declaration can incorrectly select the singular form.

